<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$328,000 Arizona tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>3-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>4-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 5-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 7-5</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 4-6 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-1 7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
